{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12687","headline":"喻瀼溪乡旧游 · 元结","name":"喻瀼溪乡旧游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往年在瀼滨，瀼人皆忘情。\n今来游瀼乡，瀼人见我惊。\n我心与瀼人，岂有辱与荣。\n瀼人异其心，应爲我冠缨。\n昔贤恶如此，所以辞公卿。\n贫穷老乡里，自休还力耕。\n况曾经逆乱，日厌闻战争。\n尤爱一溪水，而能存让名。\n终当来其滨，饮啄全此生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12687.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12687","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"星 汉"}